<title>USA: St Louis feeder cattle higher trend - USDA.</title>
<headline>St Louis feeder cattle higher trend - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>EAST ST LOUIS, Ill. 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>No recent price comparison available. However, a substantially higher price trend is apparent. Overall quality well above the past few weeks. Large buyer attendance.</p>
<p>Feeder Cattle Auction: 350 head.</p>
<p>FEEDER STEERS: Medium and Large Frame 1:</p>
<p>600-700 lbs. 63.00-68.00, Crossbreds 68.00-69.00</p>
<p>700-900 lbs. 62.00-66.00</p>
<p>Moderately Fleshy:</p>
<p>500-600 lbs. 58.00-65.00</p>
<p>600-900 lbs. 58.00-64.00</p>
<p>FEEDER HEIFERS: Medium and Large Frame 1:</p>
<p>500-800 lbs. 55.00-60.00, Crossbreds 500-600 lbs. 60.00-62.00</p>
<p>Moderately Fleshy:</p>
<p>500-600 lbs. 51.00-56.00</p>
<p>600-800 lbs. 50.00-56.00</p>
<p>Receipts 350    Last week  No report  Last Year  400</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
